  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jVmUTGFMX5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1051116089133777016?color=green&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=green&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord標章\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Just Another Xray</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">一個簡單但功能強大的<strong>Xray資源包</strong>，設計上<strong>比大多數Xray資源包更好且更清爽</strong>。</p><hr><h2>🔍 功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>以<strong>資源包</strong>形式運作（無需安裝模組）。</li>\n<li>清晰標示礦物與重要方塊。</li>\n<li>搭配<strong>夜視</strong>或<strong>Optifine</strong>以達到最高亮度。</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>📦 支援的模組</h2><p>此資源包支援多種模組：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Adabranium</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Applied Energistics 2</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Astromine</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Enderite</strong></li>\n<li><strong>End Reborn</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Forestry</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Indrev</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mekanism</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mystical Agriculture</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Quark</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tech Reborn</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Thaumcraft</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Immersive Ores</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tardis Refined</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Palladium</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Create: New Age</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Fossils and Archeology: Revival</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Yttr</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Pastel</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Malum</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Stargate Journey</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Aether</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tensura Reincarnated</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Xg's Story Mode</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Terramity</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Create</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RIG Tech</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mana And Artifice</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblocklegend001%253fr%253dCurseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners